{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/111060-uratha-immortality-how","id":111060,"title":"Uratha Immortality -- How?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-11T14:53:09-07:00","id":111060,"title":"Uratha Immortality -- How?","content":"Suppose you are a werewolf.<br /> <br /> Suppose you wish to live forever.<br /> <br /> What are the methods available, other than striking a pact with the Maeljin or some manner of demon?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>GM of the <i>Walking Shadow</i> Campaigns</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/8992-the-hacks-and-houserules-of-walking-shadows\" target=\"_blank\">New System and Setting Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1040-neotiamat","name":"NeoTiamat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1040_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"471"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T15:38:11-07:00","id":111074,"title":"","content":"Finding an high ranked spirit of Time or some similar concept (actually, even a spirit of Frost could help, with &quot;freezing you in time) and convince it/ threatening it by using its ban to give you eternal life. After all, if you don't wish to sell your soul to demons, you'll have to beg the gods.<br /> <br /> Another option could be by drawing inspiration from the Wardens from Immortals- they are people which gain immortality from the spirits of locations. While usually only regular people could be chosen in that way, maybe a cunning wolf could find a similar method which works similarly enough. Of course, there should be a disadvantage for doing it- maybe being stuck in the same age could make some problems with shapeshifting (the same would go with the previous option)<br /> <br /> Lastly, you could try to seek for a way to become a spirit- after all, you are already an half spirit. There should be a way to change your other half. Maybe it would include consuming moon and wolf spirits, creating a cult to worship you or being elevated to that position by Luna or your Firstborn by being Renowned enough. Create a legend no uratha will forget, so even if your body will fall apart, your spirit would stay forever.<br /> <br /> that's what I can pull out of my hat right now :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T15:48:29-07:00","id":111078,"title":"","content":"Get PU 10.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T15:55:39-07:00","id":111084,"title":"","content":"Just getting high Primal Urge, or a special gift from a spirit. Using the Moon's Curse concept from the Forsaken Chronicler's Guide.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 04-11-2014, 07:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T19:55:41-07:00","id":111190,"title":"","content":"Well you could go to a Goblin Market everything is for sale there. I'll bet there are ways, most splats have some witches who can be immortal through some half forbidden secrets, and Forsaken likely has just as much witches as most other splats, and since they are separated from the more self sacrificing and eternal draft themes found in Apocalypse why not. There are probably some rite can can extend age if the price is met. Power spirits as mentioned have the power.<br /> <br /> Personally I really like the idea that high Primal Urge Levels increase your lifespan. Look at Red Stick, he seems to be at least 200 years old, though he seems to spend most of that sleeping.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},