 know why <i>Dar-Us</i> was a legend? Watch a werewolf crack his neck or his knuckles sometime. A lot of us look over our shoulders when we do that, because the story is that the sound might attract his ghost. And some of us even whisper \u201c<i>Imru nu fir Imru, Dar-Us</i>,\u201d just to remind him.<br /> &quot;Even now that he\u2019s dead, we still remind him.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-13T12:51:22-07:00","id":112190,"title":"","content":"Find a spirit of immortality. deep in the place between the Shadow and the Astral Realm known as the Dreamtime.<br /> <br /> Find it.<br /> <br /> Hunt it.<br /> <br /> Devour its heart.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/209-that-other-guy","name":"That Other Guy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T09:38:08-07:00","id":112706,"title":"","content":"I use primal urge at 9-10 , the werewolf stops aging , but also he turns more spirit like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/memb